    'terms.s13.changeLabel': 'Change notification:',
    'terms.s13.change': 'The Platform may amend these Terms from time to time. Material changes (such as billing methods, data policies, user rights or liability boundaries) will be announced in advance via on-site announcements, the Discord community, email or other channels.',
    'terms.s13.acceptLabel': 'Continued use constitutes acceptance:',
    'terms.s13.accept': 'Continuing to use the Platform after a change takes effect is deemed acceptance of the revised Terms. If you do not agree to the changes, you may stop using the service and delete your account.',
    'terms.s14.breachLabel': 'Breach handling:',
